{"4137940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Obscura: A Sleep Worth Dying For", "steam_appid": 4137940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DREAM. ESCAPE THE DARK.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obscura: A Sleep Worth Dying For</strong> is a hand-drawn gothic 2D action-platformer about a sharp-witted girl trapped inside surreal worlds shaped by memory, fear, loss — and things perhaps better left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, explore and traverse seven twisted dream worlds where beauty and nightmare constantly bleed into one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But escaping the dream is only part of the problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if waking up means facing what put you there in the first place?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/cb525cf01e2392b46bde6d2abdc48f82.avif?t=1788192107\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras_big/cb525cf01e2392b46bde6d2abdc48f82.webp?t=1788192107 width=1560 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH PRECISION — NOT JUST POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura fights with throwable <strong>sais</strong>, magical <strong>scepters</strong> and strange abilities that turn combat into more than simple button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different sais bring different tactical roles — from freezing and poisoning enemies to explosive attacks and electrical effects — while <strong>Precision Targeting</strong> lets you deliberately hunt down dangerous targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scepters add another layer of magic, utility and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/c3ab7e0692f702426395e21a08f91ecf.poster.avif?t=1788192107\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/c3ab7e0692f702426395e21a08f91ecf.webm?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/c3ab7e0692f702426395e21a08f91ecf.mp4?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE THROUGH THE DREAM IN STRANGE WAYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Jump. Dash. Explore hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ride a giant spider up a wall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura’s movement expands throughout the journey with new abilities, companions and temporary mounts that change how you navigate the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some paths are obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others only become possible once you stop thinking like you’re awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/cc7611d823169e96efd7f611ff9e9b8b.poster.avif?t=1788192107\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/cc7611d823169e96efd7f611ff9e9b8b.webm?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/cc7611d823169e96efd7f611ff9e9b8b.mp4?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HANDCRAFTED NIGHTMARE — DRAWN ON PAPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura’s world begins outside the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters, environments and many visual elements are <strong>drawn by hand, colored on paper and scanned into the game</strong>, creating a textured look that deliberately keeps the imperfections of traditional artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dream worlds are meant to feel quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruins, forgotten streets, strange creatures, fog, moonlight and impossible places all reflect fragments of Obscura’s inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.poster.avif?t=1788192107\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.webm?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.mp4?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES FOLLOW YOU INTO THE DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura’s sarcastic humor may keep the darkness at arm’s length — but beneath it lies a story about memory, grief, fear and learning to live with emotions instead of being consumed by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices made through dialogue quietly shape Obscura’s path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than one way for this dream to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will she find the strength to wake up… or lose herself inside it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/78c6cb23f00fee03837aae0efad75142.avif?t=1788192107\" width=1272 height=711 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS INSIDE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven dream worlds</strong>, each with its own atmosphere, mechanics and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn visuals</strong>, created on paper and brought into the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sai combat</strong> with distinct elemental abilities and precision targeting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical scepters</strong> offering offensive, defensive and utility powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming, exploration, combat and environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets and mounts</strong> that can alter how you move through the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange power-ups</strong> ranging from useful to wonderfully absurd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful dialogue choices and multiple endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark fantasy, gothic atmosphere and dry humor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric soundtrack</strong> built around the mood of each dream</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOMETIMES THE HARDEST PART OF A NIGHTMARE IS WAKING UP.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the dream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In dreams, nothing is ever quite what it seems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/026d0f5625378fca9f93233255bb2582.avif?t=1788192107\" width=200 height=172 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DREAM. ESCAPE THE DARK.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obscura: A Sleep Worth Dying For</strong> is a hand-drawn gothic 2D action-platformer about a sharp-witted girl trapped inside surreal worlds shaped by memory, fear, loss — and things perhaps better left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, explore and traverse seven twisted dream worlds where beauty and nightmare constantly bleed into one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But escaping the dream is only part of the problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if waking up means facing what put you there in the first place?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/cb525cf01e2392b46bde6d2abdc48f82.avif?t=1788192107\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras_big/cb525cf01e2392b46bde6d2abdc48f82.webp?t=1788192107 width=1560 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH PRECISION — NOT JUST POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura fights with throwable <strong>sais</strong>, magical <strong>scepters</strong> and strange abilities that turn combat into more than simple button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different sais bring different tactical roles — from freezing and poisoning enemies to explosive attacks and electrical effects — while <strong>Precision Targeting</strong> lets you deliberately hunt down dangerous targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scepters add another layer of magic, utility and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><