DCRAFTED NIGHTMARE — DRAWN ON PAPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura’s world begins outside the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters, environments and many visual elements are <strong>drawn by hand, colored on paper and scanned into the game</strong>, creating a textured look that deliberately keeps the imperfections of traditional artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two dream worlds are meant to feel quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruins, forgotten streets, strange creatures, fog, moonlight and impossible places all reflect fragments of Obscura’s inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.poster.avif?t=1788192107\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.webm?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137940/extras/72616abdf7b04be3554c84202a32dd58.mp4?t=1788192107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CHOICES FOLLOW YOU INTO THE DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obscura’s sarcastic humor may keep the darkness at arm’s length — but beneath it lies a story about memory, grief, fear and learning to live with emotions instead of being consumed by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices made through dialogue quietly shape Obscura’s path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than one way for this dream to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will she find the strength to wake up… or lose herself inside it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"